    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6248" root="جمد" body-key="j">
    
      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جمّد</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَجْمِيدٌ</span>; (K;) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَمَدَ</span></b> ; (so
in the L;) <i>It</i> (water, and expressed juice, L)
<i>was about to congeal, concrete, become solid,</i> or
<i>freeze; was at the point of congealing,</i> &amp;c.;
expl. by <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَاوَلَ أَنْ يَجْمُدَ</span>. (L, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  [And the
former, <i>It caused</i> water &amp;c. <i>to congeal.</i>]

